{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-lob-arithmetical.md","title":"Löb's Theorem Arithmetical","display":"cor-lob-arithmetical — Löb's Theorem Arithmetical","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-lob-arithmetical","aliases":["89-cor-lob-arithmetical"],"display":"cor-lob-arithmetical — Löb's Theorem Arithmetical","depends_on":["[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]","[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","[[88-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-lob-arithmetical"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-lob-arithmetical</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-lob-arithmetical — Löb's Theorem Arithmetical"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"77b58358ab49cf8f\" href=\"?note=77b58358ab49cf8f\" title=\"89-thm-lob-theorem\">89-thm-lob-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is the\nPA-provable-sentence set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> is the standard one-free-variable PA\nprovability formula.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\)</span> holds.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lob\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lob\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\)</span> : 对象语言句子\n“如果 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 可证则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>”</li>\n<li>Löb定理：如果这可证，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>本身可证</li>\n<li>GL公理L的算术版本</li>\n<li>横线不可省略：Gödel 数属于元层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，其数码才可代入对象语言\n可证明性公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-hilbert-bernays","status":"resolved","id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}lob\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":1489,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-506","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-cor-lob-arithmetical]]"}],"outgoing":["77b58358ab49cf8f","86ad48bbd1843ed6","841985de31202f85","2d52ad4f119b4a14","9aca87310232fb2f","69c0e9e2e8f423a6"]}